<InfoPage path="/register/" label="Registration guide" heading="How to Register for a Yarrwin Account" title="Yarrwin Register Guide | Account Safety Checks" description="Learn what to check before registering for a Yarrwin account and how to protect your details." >
  <h2>Check before registering</h2><p>Read the platform address, terms and privacy information before entering an email, phone number or payment detail. This website is an independent guide, so verify the destination yourself and confirm that registration is available in your location.</p>
  <h2>Registration basics</h2><p>Use contact details you control, create a long unique password and save recovery information securely. Review every field before submitting. Do not create an account through a modified application or a page that asks for an OTP before you understand why it is needed.</p>
  <h2>After sign-up</h2><p>Check the confirmation message in your own inbox, sign in from the same verified address and review account settings. If identity checks, age checks or local restrictions apply, follow the platform’s current instructions. Never borrow money to fund play.</p>
</InfoPage>
